                                    "verticalAlign": false,
                                    "body": {
                                        "processed": "<p><span class=\"subhead color-accent\">Higher Education</span></p>\n<h1>Emory University - AAE</h1>\n<p>A full rebuild of a university website paired with a migration of its e-commerce system to Shopify. The goal was to eliminate outdated workflows, improve performance, and unify content and commerce into a seamless user experience.</p>\n<p><a class=\"button transparent\" href=\"https://together.emory.edu\" target=\"_blank\" tabindex=\"0\">View Website</a></p>\n"
                                    }
                                }
