                                    {
                                        "__typename": "ParagraphText",
                                        "id": "149",
                                        "verticalAlign": false,
                                        "body": {
                                            "processed": "<p class=\"text-align-center\"><span class=\"subhead color-accent\">Case Study</span></p>\n<p class=\"text-align-center\"><span class=\"h3\">Challenge</span></p>\n<p class=\"text-align-center\">I inherited a templated website built on an outdated Drupal 9 architecture that combined both content and e-commerce into a single system. The site suffered from significant performance issues, slow load times, and lacked scalability. Although React had been layered in to improve speed, the underlying structure wasn’t designed to support modern performance or growth.</p>\n"
                                        }
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "__typename": "ParagraphSection",
                        "id": "156",
                        "bgColor": "rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05)",
                        "bgImage": {
                            "__typename": "MediaBackgroundImage",
                            "id": "13",
                            "mediaImage2": {
                                "url": "__ORIGIN__/sites/default/files/2026-07/noisy-texture-200x200-o39-d95-c-4ac1af-t1.png"
                            }
                        },
                        "bgImagePosition": "center center",
                        "bgImageRepeat": "repeat",
                        "bgImageSize": "auto",
                        "centerContent": false,
                        "fullWidth": false,
                        "margin": null,
                        "padding": "padding-top-bottom-60",
                        "sectionId": null,
                        "content": [
                            {
                                "__typename": "ParagraphColumn",
                                "id": "153",
                                "bgColor": null,
                                "sectionId": null,
                                "columnWidth": [
                                    "col-lg-6"
                                ],
                                "styledBox": false,
                                "element": [
                                    {
                                        "__typename": "ParagraphText",
                                        "id": "152",
                                        "verticalAlign": false,
                                        "body": {
                                            "processed": "<p><span class=\"subhead color-accent\">Solution</span></p>\n<p><span class=\"h3\">Decoupling &amp; Rebuild</span></p>\n<p>To stabilize and modernize the platform, I led a foundational restructuring:</p>\n<ul>\n<li data-list-item-id=\"e446628371ffc5bf38292473425a99eb3\">Separated e-commerce from the main website, migrating all transactional functionality to Shopify</li>\n<li data-list-item-id=\"e713152389340a21aecee11a13bfe765b\">Rebuilt the website on Drupal 11, establishing a scalable, future-ready CMS</li>\n<li data-list-item-id=\"e8f30d3b9f4ad8080011e6aa68050e419\">Redesigned the content architecture, introducing structured content types such as Person, Event, Article, Trip, and Vlog</li>\n<li data-list-item-id=\"e4f37df884dc0c72ae9621f3b39c4e8b0\">Implemented lazy loading across all media, significantly improving perceived performance</li>\n<li data-list-item-id=\"efcded48e80db95b83e9d240e632300a0\">Removed unnecessary complexity, eliminating reliance on React for performance fixes and instead solving issues at the architectural level</li>\n</ul>\n"
                                        }
                                    }
                                ]
                            },
                            {
                                "__typename": "ParagraphColumn",
                                "id": "155",
                                "bgColor": null,
                                "sectionId": null,
                                "columnWidth": [
