                                        "__typename": "ParagraphText",
                                        "id": "157",
                                        "verticalAlign": false,
                                        "body": {
                                            "processed": "<p class=\"text-align-center\"><span class=\"subhead color-accent\">Success</span></p>\n<p class=\"text-align-center\"><span class=\"h3\">Impact</span></p>\n<p class=\"text-align-center\">By decoupling the systems and rebuilding with a focus on scalability and performance, the platform transformed from a slow, rigid experience into a fast, maintainable ecosystem. The marketing site became more flexible and content-driven, while the e-commerce experience gained reliability and performance through Shopify.</p>\n<p class=\"text-align-center\">This separation allowed each platform to excel in its role—resulting in a cleaner user experience, faster load times, and a foundation built for long-term growth.</p>\n"
                                        }
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
